        "alternatives": "Planned IM 43 beds to cover its full census, but max_beds is 40, so it was rejected as invalid. Simulated beds 26/40/16/14 with two nurse splits. A: nurses C11/IM13/N9/O4 gives 1 level-1 IM overflow (P000919), no level-2 or level-3 nurse shortage, and level-1 shortage IM 1.8 and ortho 0.15. B: nurses C10/IM14/N9/O4 gives the same overflow, but a small level-2 shortage in cardiology (0.1) while covering more level-1 need in IM.",
